{"parse": {"title": "再会在新世界-02", "pageid": 142058, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%86%8D%E4%BC%9A%E5%9C%A8%E6%96%B0%E4%B8%96%E7%95%8C-01\" title=\"再会在新世界-01\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">再会在新世界-02</span><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%86%8D%E4%BC%9A%E5%9C%A8%E6%96%B0%E4%B8%96%E7%95%8C-03\" title=\"再会在新世界-03\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">再会在新世界</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">02</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E4.B8.A4.E7.AB.AF.E7.87.83.E7.83.A7.E7.9A.84.E6.9E.9D.E6.9D.88\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"两端燃烧的枝杈\">两端燃烧的枝杈</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 两端燃烧的枝杈</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">Burning from Both Ends</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"><div class=\"tabber-filter-item selected\" data-type=\"index\" data-index=\"1\" style=\"padding:8px 4px; margin-bottom:-8px;\"><div class=\"episode-nav-item episode-nav-battle\"><i class=\"selected-icon\"><img alt=\"选中\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Img_xuanzhong.png/20px-Img_xuanzhong.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"选中\" width=\"20\" height=\"19\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Img_xuanzhong.png/30px-Img_xuanzhong.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Img_xuanzhong.png/40px-Img_xuanzhong.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"48\" data-file-height=\"46\" /></i>玩法前</div></div><div class=\"tabber-filter-item\" data-type=\"index\" data-index=\"2\" style=\"padding:8px 4px; margin-bottom:-8px;\"><div class=\"episode-nav-item episode-nav-battle\"><i class=\"selected-icon\"><img alt=\"选中\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Img_xuanzhong.png/20px-Img_xuanzhong.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"选中\" width=\"20\" height=\"19\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Img_xuanzhong.png/30px-Img_xuanzhong.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Img_xuanzhong.png/40px-Img_xuanzhong.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"48\" data-file-height=\"46\" /></i>玩法后</div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"tabber-item tabber\" data-type=\"index\" data-index=\"1\"><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-luyingdi_zhou.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"luyingdi_zhou\"><img alt=\"luyingdi_zhou\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/be/Cg-luyingdi_zhou.png/600px-Cg-luyingdi_zhou.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/be/Cg-luyingdi_zhou.png/900px-Cg-luyingdi_zhou.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/be/Cg-luyingdi_zhou.png/1200px-Cg-luyingdi_zhou.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>疏离，专业，一丝不苟。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>眼前的基金会工作人员符合奠基石对他们的基本印象，仿佛连衬衫的褶皱都规整地平行着。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>——除了他们会面的地点不太对以外。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>好奇的建筑师向后张望，再三确认自己的眼睛没有出问题。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>大大小小的帐篷群立在林地上，这些平日里非常拘谨的公务人员们正满面苦涩地品尝着小铁锅里煮出来的豆子罐头。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>这景色实在是过于稀罕，以至于奠基石在心里默默为没能亲眼一见的蓝图感到几分惋惜。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>呃，抱歉……这里今天恰好是在举办……童子军露营活动吗？还是别的什么？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>奠基石面前的人似乎是想到自己要负责解释这荒诞的一幕，本就算不上愉快的五官更加苦涩地扭结在了一起。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"508601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/09/HeadIconSmall-508601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-508601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"508601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/09/HeadIconSmall-508601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-508601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/09/HeadIconSmall-508601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-508601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">罗塞拉：</div><div>蓝图女士，这事说来话长了……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>我是奠基石。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">罗塞拉：</div><div>奠基石女士……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>不知道是不是奠基石的错觉，她感觉对面的人似乎快要哭出来了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>哦，我的错。是我临时和你们的蓝图女士交换了下工作，随后我会把交接手续办完的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>总之，我是来帮你们的，不管有什么难处，尽管和我说就是。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">罗塞拉：</div><div>谢天谢地。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">罗塞拉：</div><div>我们都知道，只有总部的建筑区域能庇护我们越过“暴雨”……但我们总要在世界各地设立办事处来行使基金会的职能。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">罗塞拉：</div><div>利用既有的建筑或自建一栋基金会的办事处，基金会的同僚们在这点上产生了分歧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">罗塞拉：</div><div>于是我们向基金会申请了这片用地，来验证自建基金会办事处的可行性。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>空气湿润，鸟儿欢唱，连蜘蛛和壁虎都很有活力。这儿确实是一处好地方。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">罗塞拉：</div><div>——最重要的是，它距离机场非常近，能允许我们以最快的速度在“暴雨”前集体撤回总部。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">罗塞拉：</div><div>好的地理位置胜过一切。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>负责人恰到好处地补充道。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>不过你说除了总部之外的建筑……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">罗塞拉：</div><div>是的，目前世界上只有总部具备“不可回溯地”的性质，女士。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>想起了蓝图再三叮嘱自己的保密事项后，奠基石将嘴边的话咽了回去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>对于基金会内部来说，“不可回溯地”的真正数量与位置是不能广而告之的秘密。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">罗塞拉：</div><div>回到正题，因为“暴雨”落下的不确定性，这栋建筑使用了“预制板结构”，能够在两周内完工。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>哦，我很熟悉这种建筑，我的童年就是在这种建筑堆成的社区里度过的。它有个更广为人知的名字——“筒子楼”。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">罗塞拉：</div><div>是的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>好，那么说到这里……我差不多知道我要来做什么了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>一定是这栋建筑出了什么安全性上的问题变成了危楼，你们才不得不在室外暂时避险。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>说实话，我认为这种时候应该安排你们入驻旅馆，总比在外面和壁虎抢食要好。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">罗塞拉：</div><div>最近的旅馆在七十公里开外，女士。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>咳。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>排查建筑隐患，检查建筑的应力结构……这确实是我那位同僚擅长的领域。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>但别担心，我也具有同样的资质，安心把这件事交给我就好。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">罗塞拉：</div><div>呃，蓝图女士……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>我是奠基石……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">罗塞拉：</div><div>实际上办事处的建筑主体没有任何问题。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>什么……？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">罗塞拉：</div><div>您熟悉“鬼魂”吗？所谓的“骚灵”或者随便您怎么叫它们。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>我甚至有许多“鬼魂”朋友。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">罗塞拉：</div><div>哦，那太好了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">罗塞拉：</div><div>我们向总部求助的内容是，希望能下派一名熟悉“鬼魂”且有建筑师资质的调查员帮助我们解决异常事件。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">罗塞拉：</div><div>于是总部向我们推荐了蓝图女士。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>“鬼魂”……？我不明白为什么你们需要一个懂“鬼魂”的建筑师。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>基金会应该也有不少擅长除灵的神秘学家才对，你们应该向他们求助。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">罗塞拉：</div><div>您说得对，当骚灵现象出现后，我们第一时间按照《办公遇鬼应急手册》上的指南，联系了最近的除灵师。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">罗塞拉：</div><div>但他们都被拎着领子从房子里扔了出来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>……他们有说建筑里发生了什么吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">罗塞拉：</div><div>只有一句话。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">罗塞拉：</div><div>那个强大的“鬼魂”说——带一个会建房子的人去见它。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>我明白了……或许我一开始确实误会了工作内容，但别担心，这一切仍然在我的专业范围内。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>我对这种调皮的、不怀好意的、喜欢吃橡皮擦和稿纸的小家伙有丰富的处理经验，绝大多数的它们和新生的孩子没有两样。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">罗塞拉：</div><div>您的话令我感到安心，蓝图女士。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>我是奠基石。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>顺带一提……你们有给我准备帐篷吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">罗塞拉：</div><div>呃……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>或者咖啡？总之能替代睡眠的任何东西都可以。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>我想，我可能有几天没有睡觉了。我的心脏好像正在敲打我的胸腔，嘴里说着什么听不懂但很要紧的话，听上去像是“心源性猝死警告”之类的……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">罗塞拉：</div><div>哦我的天啊，但您气色看起来其实还不错，真是不可思议。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>谢谢，在连续一周睡眠不足后还要满面春光地去会见客户是建筑设计师的必修课。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>看上去病弱又怠倦的设计师可没办法守住自己的底线。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">罗塞拉：</div><div>我知道了，您可以从右手边走，前往七号帐篷，那顶帐篷原本的主人在昨天回到了基金会总部。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">罗塞拉：</div><div>我们的调查可以明天再开始。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>您真是善解人意。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>……哈，抱歉，我真的得去休息了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">罗塞拉：</div><div>我们十一个小时后再见。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">罗塞拉：</div><div>祝您好梦，蓝图女士。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>我是……算了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>晚安。</div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"tabber-item tabber\" data-type=\"index\" data-index=\"2\"><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"story-text\"><div>和现在的季节不同，斯塔夏受邀来到学院的时候，是个黄昏的余温仍能将柏油烘烤出焦香的夏季。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>那是一段非常不足为道的时光。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>童年也好，学生时代也好，或者真正成为一名建筑师后也好——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>未能落地的畅想，焦头烂额的作业，最春风得意的日子……都要比这段时光更加值得被铭记。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-daxuekeshi.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"daxuekeshi\"><img alt=\"daxuekeshi\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/02/Cg-daxuekeshi.png/600px-Cg-daxuekeshi.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/02/Cg-daxuekeshi.png/900px-Cg-daxuekeshi.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/02/Cg-daxuekeshi.png/1200px-Cg-daxuekeshi.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5c/HeadIconSmall-314001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5c/HeadIconSmall-314001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5c/HeadIconSmall-314001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>但是……却是这间教室，如回声一般反反复复地出现在我的梦里。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5c/HeadIconSmall-314001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5c/HeadIconSmall-314001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5c/HeadIconSmall-314001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>这里没有以业余的审美挑剔我的无聊官员。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5c/HeadIconSmall-314001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5c/HeadIconSmall-314001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5c/HeadIconSmall-314001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>这里也没有为了抢夺经济地段，而罔顾规划与合理性的可耻商人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5c/HeadIconSmall-314001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5c/HeadIconSmall-314001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5c/HeadIconSmall-314001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>我不觉得我是那种为创伤感到困苦的神秘学家，也不会在梦中一遍遍反刍那些令内心感到痛苦的场景。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314011.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2b/HeadIconSmall-314011.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314011.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314011.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2b/HeadIconSmall-314011.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314011.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2b/HeadIconSmall-314011.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314011.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>好吧……或许建筑师资格考试勉强算一件，我总是梦见自己回到那间考场却没带准考证。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314010.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a3/HeadIconSmall-314010.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314010.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314010.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a3/HeadIconSmall-314010.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314010.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a3/HeadIconSmall-314010.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314010.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>但建筑师总归是更喜爱未来的职业。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"653810.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-653810.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-653810.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"653810.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-653810.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-653810.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-653810.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-653810.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>是的，未来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>……杜法赦？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"653801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1d/HeadIconSmall-653801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-653801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"653801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1d/HeadIconSmall-653801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-653801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1d/HeadIconSmall-653801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-653801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">杜法赦：</div><div>您从来没和我们聊过您自己的作品，我也没能亲眼看见过它们。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"653801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1d/HeadIconSmall-653801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-653801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"653801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1d/HeadIconSmall-653801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-653801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1d/HeadIconSmall-653801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-653801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">杜法赦：</div><div>所以我又来了，您愿意和我聊聊它们吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>这是梦，梦的主人本不必回答梦中虚影的问题。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>……我第一次离开学徒的身份，独立设计的作品是一间仓库。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-wuguangchang.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"wuguangchang\"><img alt=\"wuguangchang\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/97/Cg-wuguangchang.png/600px-Cg-wuguangchang.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/97/Cg-wuguangchang.png/900px-Cg-wuguangchang.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/97/Cg-wuguangchang.png/1200px-Cg-wuguangchang.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5c/HeadIconSmall-314001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5c/HeadIconSmall-314001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5c/HeadIconSmall-314001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>老实说，和图书馆……剧院……行政机关比起来，它不需要美感，不需要理念，只需要你在被规划好的土地上放置一个符合规范的储藏空间就可以了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314015.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/83/HeadIconSmall-314015.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314015.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314015.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/83/HeadIconSmall-314015.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314015.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/83/HeadIconSmall-314015.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314015.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>但即便如此……我还是搞砸了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5c/HeadIconSmall-314001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5c/HeadIconSmall-314001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5c/HeadIconSmall-314001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>那之后又过了几年，真正让我变得小有名气的是一座公园。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"653801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1d/HeadIconSmall-653801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-653801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"653801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1d/HeadIconSmall-653801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-653801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1d/HeadIconSmall-653801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-653801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">杜法赦：</div><div>不是一栋楼吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5c/HeadIconSmall-314001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5c/HeadIconSmall-314001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5c/HeadIconSmall-314001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>不，建筑师们能做的事比你想的要多很多。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5c/HeadIconSmall-314001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5c/HeadIconSmall-314001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5c/HeadIconSmall-314001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>但总之，我在那里摆了个如今看来我也觉得有些浮夸和轻佻的观景台，它的造型吸引了不少人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5c/HeadIconSmall-314001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5c/HeadIconSmall-314001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5c/HeadIconSmall-314001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>那之后，我慢慢有了脱离事务所单干，甚至登上杂志的资本。而报纸上用着我理解不了的词汇去概括我的设计风格。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"653801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1d/HeadIconSmall-653801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-653801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"653801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1d/HeadIconSmall-653801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-653801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1d/HeadIconSmall-653801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-653801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">杜法赦：</div><div>它们还在吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314016.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d5/HeadIconSmall-314016.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314016.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314016.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d5/HeadIconSmall-314016.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314016.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d5/HeadIconSmall-314016.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314016.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>不在了，亲爱的。现在是1987年。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314016.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d5/HeadIconSmall-314016.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314016.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314016.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d5/HeadIconSmall-314016.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314016.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d5/HeadIconSmall-314016.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314016.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>……它们和你们一起消失在了雨幕里。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">杜法赦：</div><div>是的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">杜法赦：</div><div>还有“未来”。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>“未来”……</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_8_bg_01.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_8_bg_01\"><img alt=\"3_8_bg_01\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e4/Cg-3_8_bg_01.png/600px-Cg-3_8_bg_01.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e4/Cg-3_8_bg_01.png/900px-Cg-3_8_bg_01.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e4/Cg-3_8_bg_01.png/1200px-Cg-3_8_bg_01.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">杜法赦：</div><div>那些消逝在雨幕里的……那些帮助你们越过雨幕的……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">杜法赦：</div><div>那些您想铭记在水门汀上的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">杜法赦：</div><div>——不仅仅是旧事物在消亡。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">杜法赦：</div><div>在“暴雨”中，崭新的，本应诞生的，属于未来的……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">杜法赦：</div><div>它们也一同逝去了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">杜法赦：</div><div>……好似一根两端都被点燃的树枝。</div></div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "再会在新世界-02"}}